Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.13,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}No hay ninguna\Nforma oficial
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.14,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}de conseguir\NGTA 6 gratis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:10.28,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Se compra para\NPlayStation 5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.09,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}o Xbox Series,\Ny punto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:15.12,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Las webs, aplicaciones\Ny sorteos que te
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.48,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}lo regalan a cambio\Nde tus datos o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.53,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}de tu contraseña\Nson estafas:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.39,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}buscan robar tu cuenta\No meterte un virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:23.78,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Regla de oro:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.60,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}nunca des la\Ncontraseña de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.66,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}PlayStation o\Nde Xbox a nadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:29.42,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Ningún sorteo\Nlegal te la
